          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Slahhángw faanqw bál bar mibaangw an baalár hhoohhoo' dirhunge. Baalaadae kuungá' an gwaawindá' nee ma gadiyuusara'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ un ilahhooár dá/tí hanisá', tawa slaahhareeraá tsuuá' awa inós ngu sla'atimiisá'. Awuú wák oo batlitamo nee gwaanduú wák nee deeloó gwaandaawe faanqw oo kurkú wák. Sleémeero masók ki xaslxaansli wasl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilahhooár balaangw an hanisá' ar puuruú natsaatsaá' oo ta aleedoók nee di/i, awu kun kílo tám alhaniis, gwaanda kun kílo tsár alhaniis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee deelayduú gwaandaawe faanqwamaawo umuú deelmoowo kun kílo wák alhaniis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gurtuú wák un hanisá' tawa ilahhooár tlakweema hingeesa dinkwa nee ilahhooadár tlakweema hingeesa as haraki/isarhúng, dinkwa nee ilahhooár da/a tidár umuú baala, nee ilahhooarós ar balaangw nee ilahhooarós ar muruú wahaangw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
