          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Slahhángw faanqw bál bar mibaá nee kooán, dinku'uumár hhoohhoo' ka tlehhá'. Baalaarihe ma gadiyuusara'. Deeloorí ur an AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i tlehhá' ay deelo faanqw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilahhooár da/a an hanisá' tawa slaahhareeraá tsuuá' awa AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngu sla'atimiisá', muruú ta hanisa' a kwí: Awér batlaay mibaá nee tám, nee gwaandaawe tsár, nee deeloó gwaandaawe mibaá nee tsiyáhh oo kurkú wák. Sleémeero masók ki xaslxaansli wasl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilahhooár balaangw an hanisá' ar puuruú natsaatsaá' oo taa aledoók nee di/i, baraá aweedá' mibaá nee tame umuúqo awuuwo un kílo tám alhanisá' nee umuúqo gwaanduwo un kílo tsár alhanisá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee baraá gwaandaawedá' mibaá nee tsiyahhe umuúqo gwaanduwo un kílór wák alhanisá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee gurtuú wák un hanisá' tawa ilahhooár tlakweema hingeesa. Dinkwa nee tihe ilahhooár da/a tidár umuú baala nee ilahhooarós ar balaango, nee ilahhooarós ar muruú wahaango makawa máy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
