          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinkwa nee ilahhooár balaangw nee ar muruú wahaangw an aweedá' alhanisá', nee gwaandaaweero, nee deelayduú bee/aango adoodá' hariímár faaror'ín i diri'. ",
