              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilahhooár da/a an hanisá' kuwa da/a' ar asla tawa slaahhareeraá tsuuá' awa AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngu sla'atamiisá. Muruú ta hanisa' a kwí: Awuú wák, nee gwaanduú wák, nee deeloó gwaandaawe oo faanqw oo kurkú wák, masók ki xaslxaansli wasl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
